# CLAUDE.md Update Policy

After any non-trivial change, update the relevant `CLAUDE.md` file(s) **in the same turn** as the code change.

## Trigger conditions

Update **`src/CLAUDE.md`** when you change:
- Route structure (add/remove/rename pages or layouts under `src/app/`)
- Session guard names or signatures (`requireUser`, `requirePlatformOwner`, `requireTenantAccessBySlug`, `requireTenantAdminBySlug`)
- Server action patterns (new `bind(null, ...)` arguments, new action files)
- i18n dict namespaces or top-level keys
- Supabase client usage patterns

Update **`tests/CLAUDE.md`** when you change:
- Test helper APIs (`tests/helpers/`)
- Mock strategy for integration tests
- E2E test URL patterns or sign-in helpers

Update **`CLAUDE.md`** (root) when you change:
- Session guard signatures
- Route overview
- Reserved slugs list
- Running commands or secrets

Update **`supabase/CLAUDE.md`** when you change:
- Migration naming conventions
- Seed data patterns

## What does NOT require an update
- Bug fixes that don't change API surface
- Style/copy changes
- Adding a new page that follows existing patterns exactly
